data: {"text":"1. My client, M/s Ganga Construction Pvt. Ltd., a company incorporated under the Companies Act, 2013, and"}

data: {"text":" having its registered office at [address], is a reputed construction company engaged in the business of civil construction"}

data: {"text":" works, infrastructure development, and related services. My client has been successfully executing various government contracts with"}

data: {"text":" utmost diligence and has established a strong reputation in the construction industry for timely completion"}

data: {"text":" of projects and maintaining quality standards.\n\n2. My client was awarded a contract for construction of culverts on NH-31 vide Work Order No. BR"}

data: {"text":"CD/PAT/2024/118 dated 12.06.2024 by the Bihar Road Construction Department, Government of Bihar, for a contract value of Rs. 2,75,00,000/-"}

data: {"text":" (Rupees Two Crores Seventy-Five Lakhs only). The said work order was issued"}

data: {"text":" by your office and my client accepted the same and commenced"}

data: {"text":" the construction work in accordance with the terms and conditions stipulated therein.\n\n3. My client executed the contracted"}

data: {"text":" work with utmost dedication and completed all the contracted work by 28.02.2026, well within the stipulated time frame. Upon"}

data: {"text":" completion of the work, my client submitted the final running bills along with measurement books duly signed by the site engineer, as required under"}

data: {"text":" the terms of the contract. All necessary documentation and compliance requirements were duly fulfilled"}

data: {"text":" by my client as per the contract terms.\n\n4. Despite completion of all contracted work and submission of requisite documents, the Executive Engineer,"}

data: {"text":" Bihar Road Construction Department, Government of Bihar has failed to release the final payment of Rs. 87,50,000/- (Rupees Eighty-Seven Lakhs Fifty Thousand only) which"}

data: {"text":" has remained outstanding since 28.02.2026. My client made repeated requests and sent"}

data: {"text":" reminders dated 05.03.2026, 22.03.2026, and 18.04.2026 to your office for release of the said"}

data: {"text":" outstanding amount, but no positive response has been received.\n\n5. The wrongful withholding of the legitimately due"}

data: {"text":" payment of Rs. 87,50,000/- by your office has caused severe financial loss and reputational damage to my client. My client has been compelled to arrange"}

data: {"text":" funds from other sources at high interest rates to meet its financial obligations, thereby suffering"}

data: {"text":" monetary losses. The non-payment has also adversely affected my client's business operations and cash flow, causing"}

data: {"text":" immense hardship.\n\n6. Section 80 of the Code of Civil Procedure, 1908 mandates that no"}

data: {"text":" suit shall be instituted against the Government or a public officer in respect of any act pur"}

data: {"text":"porting to be done by such public officer in his official capacity until the expiration of two months next after notice"}

data: {"text":" in writing has been delivered to, or left at the office of such public officer. This legal notice"}

data: {"text":" is being served in compliance with the said statutory provision."}

data: {"text":"\n\n7. My client, being a law-abiding entity, is serving this notice upon you"}

data: {"text":" before initiating any legal proceedings and is providing you with an opportunity to rectify the situation and"}

data: {"text":" release the outstanding payment along with applicable interest as per the contract terms.\n\n8."}

data: {"text":" TAKE NOTICE that you are hereby called upon to release the outstanding payment of Rs. 87,50,000/- along"}

data: {"text":" with applicable interest as per the contract terms within a period of sixty (60) days from the receipt of this notice, failing which my client shall"}

data: {"text":" be constrained to initiate appropriate legal proceedings against you and the Government of Bihar for recovery of the said amount along"}

data: {"text":" with interest, damages, and costs of the proceedings."}

